**`δ=5/2`, `μ_2`.**  The place is `σ=⋯+π t^{5/2}`.  Clearing `s²=t` gives a
term `π s^5`; Galois `s↦−s` of `k((s))/k((t))` sends `π↦−π`.  Unique
