The depth-5 branch-B system showed the problem clearly: the first unforced top-band coefficient `g_27_67` is linearly killed, but because it was left inside the induced Fbar bands it spawned many nonlinear multiples. I’m patching the builder to pre-substitute every visible non-leading `z^27` coefficient, which is exactly the top Jacobian band constraint and keeps the later bands from carrying dead variables.
