+        f"`{autos['degree_ge_6_same_infinity']['degrees']}` and direct "
+        f"Jacobian `{autos['degree_ge_6_same_infinity']['jacobian']}`.  The "
+        "two-infinity control remains the linear witness `A=2,C=1`, `J=1`."
