+        "The rigid branch-B Prop. 6.2 high-z joint systems are nonunit through "
+        "depth 8 over `GF(32003)`, `GF(32009)`, `GF(32027)`, and `Q`.  No "
+        "`[1]` certificate was produced.  The result is a bounded necessary "
+        "system, not a Keller pair and not a `SURVIVES` claim."
+    )
