+        "by `sha256sum -c`; all nine frozen inputs returned `OK`.  The driver "
+        f"also wrote `{result['charged_input_verification']['manifest']}` and "
+        "recomputed the same digests."
+    )
+    lines.append("")
+    lines.append("## System Boundary")
+    lines.append("")
