+        "charged input, the `e0` parameter in Xu's reduced `q1` is not part of "
+        "this Prop. 6.2 high-z Fbar/Gbar system."
+    )
+    lines.append("")
+    lines.append(
+        "At depth `d`, the driver uses `Gbar` bands `z^27,...,z^(28-d)` and "
