+        "through depth 6 over `GF(32003)`, `GF(32009)`, `GF(32027)`, and `Q`. "
+        "They are nonunit; no `[1]` certificate was produced.  Depth 7 is the "
+        "next nonlinear system and was not solved in this bounded run."
