+        "`R=pi^25(pi+3)^14(pi-2)`.  Direct differentiation gives "
+        "`2 H R_z - 25 H_z R = 5 H^14`, with multiplicity vector `(25,14)`.  "
+        "No branch-face parameter is present in the branch-B Singular rings."
+    )
+    lines.append("")
